# Shell scripts MUST be LF even when checked out on Windows — Git Bash / WSL /
# the Linux VPS all choke on a CRLF shebang (`#!/usr/bin/env bash\r`). The
# operator authors on Windows (BRD §3) but the deploy target is Linux, so pin
# eol=lf for every script regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
